# Identifiers that must never appear in this public repository.
# Copy to `.identifiers` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
#   <label shown in the report>|<extended regex>
#
# organisation name|[Aa][Cc][Mm][Ee]
# ticket keys|\bACME-[0-9]+\b
# token prefix of the source system|--acme-
# people|Firstname Lastname|Othername
# internal product names|Command Centre|Customer Workspace
# laptop paths|/Users/[a-z]+/|/home/[a-z]+/
